The '''games''' repository is a collection of ''addictive'' HTML5 games written in '''JavaScript''', '''HTML''', and '''CSS'''. These games are designed to be ''old style'' and entertaining. The repository provides a simple way to access and play these games online. The games can be played at [http://tommalbran.github.io/games/].

== Overview ==
The '''games''' repository is a compilation of various HTML5 games that can be played directly in a web browser. The games are built using '''JavaScript''', '''HTML''', and '''CSS''', making them compatible with a wide range of devices and browsers.

=== Features ===
The repository includes a variety of games that are ''easy to play'' and ''fun'' to use. Some of the key features of the games include:
* '''Addictive gameplay''': The games are designed to be engaging and challenging, making them ''hard to put down''.
* '''Simple controls''': The games have ''intuitive'' controls, making it easy for players to jump in and start playing.
* '''Old style graphics''': The games have a ''retro'' feel, with ''simple'' yet ''charming'' graphics.

== Installation ==
To play the games, no installation is required. Simply visit the [http://tommalbran.github.io/games/] website and start playing. The games are hosted online, making them accessible from any device with a web browser.

== Play ==
To start playing, go to [http://tommalbran.github.io/games/] and have ''fun''. The website provides a simple and easy-to-use interface for accessing and playing the games.